    <string name="settings_robust_hint">Keeps a small permanent notification and the app running in the background so phones that stop apps (ColorOS, MIUI, OriginOS…) do not lose your reminders. Recommended if reminders do not arrive. Uses no network.</string>
    <string name="settings_robust_hint_recommended">Recommended on this phone: its system stops apps in the background and loses their alarms. Keeps a small permanent notification and the app running so your reminders arrive. Uses no network.</string>
